{"note_id":53,"date":"2025-03-18","note_type":"Operative Pathology Report","content":"Procedure performed 2025-03-18: left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy. Final surgical pathology shows invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.4 cm, Nottingham grade 2, with associated intermediate-grade DCIS. Margins negative for invasive carcinoma and DCIS. Three sentinel lymph nodes examined, all negative for carcinoma (0/3). Pathologic stage pT2 pN0(sn). Post-op recovery uncomplicated aside from mild axillary soreness and a small resolving seroma.","summary":"The patient underwent a left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy; pathology showed a 2.4 cm grade 2 invasive ductal carcinoma with intermediate‑grade DCIS, negative margins, and three negative sentinel nodes, staging the disease as pT2 pN0(sn). Post‑operative recovery was uncomplicated aside from mild axillary soreness and a small resolving seroma.","concepts":{"cancer":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.4 cm, Nottingham grade 2, with associated intermediate-grade DCIS"}]},"metastasis":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"surgery":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"left breast lumpectomy with sentinel lymph node biopsy"}]},"chemotherapy":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"radiation":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"lymph_nodes_removed":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"sentinel lymph node biopsy"},{"note_id":53,"text":"Three sentinel lymph nodes examined"}]}},"cancer_status":["current"],"cancer_mentions":[{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.4 cm, Nottingham grade 2"}],"status":"current","affected_tissue":"left breast","metastasis":false},{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":53,"text":"associated intermediate-grade DCIS"}],"stat